'''''Ptychostomum''''' is a genus of [[moss]]es belonging to the family [[Bryaceae]]. It has an almost [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Ptychostomum Hornsch. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/3230073 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=14 July 2022 |language=en}}</ref> It has two subgenera, ''Psychostomum'' (''Ptychostomum'') and ''Psychostomum'' (''Cladodium'').<ref>{{cite web |title=Ptychostomum |url=http://beta.floranorthamerica.org/Ptychostomum |website=Flora of North America}}</ref><ref>{{eFloras|1|127600|Ptychostomum|first=John R. |last=Spence |access-date=15 July 2024}}</ref>

